&s=0e0fd67925d694944195d57137c425fb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私の大好きなVtuberのアートをお願いしたいです。名前は「るるみ ゆめみ」で、歯が好きな幼稚でメンヘラな葬儀屋さんです。\n\nスパイス耐性が非常に高いので、溶岩を美味しそうに食べているところをお願いしたいです。でも、他にやりたいことがあれば遠慮なく変えてください。\n\n彼女はサムネイルやストリーム・スケジュールなどに作品を使いたいかもしれない。彼女は通常クレジットを提供する。\n\nありがとう！\n\nhttps://twitter.com/RurumiYumemi/status/1537499049980440576\n\nhttps://twitter.com/RurumiYumemi/status/1537499049980440576", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 72789, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "迷郎", "screen_name": "meirou715", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1824730672172576768/RpoSksjU.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/296048291/1745838174/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 176}, {"id": 146531, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "稲荷", "screen_name": "Inari_9999", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1961984266377801728/Em79P_-F.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2374022438/1685291566/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 128}, {"id": 146934, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "さいとう", "screen_name": "saitouyo1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1479397533298622464/3ty_l8sU.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/947788546286305281/1574855384/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": n